From 11d52f641ef37c205366c51991a61d6827ba03fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:29:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: reconcile retained disk release after instance
 deletion

Keep the first guarded inventory through instance deletion and wait for
those disks to be released, disappear, or rebind to another instance.
Do not finish cleanup while a retained disk still belongs to the old VM.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
---
